  TITLE     Baraitser-Winter cerebrofrontofacial syndrome
  JOURNAL   Clin Genet 92 (1), 3-9 (2017)
   PUBMED   27625340
  REMARK    GeneRIF: Baraitser-Winter cerebrofrontofacial syndrome is caused by
            missense mutations in the cytoplasmic beta- and gamma-actin genes
            ACTB and ACTG1. We provide an overview of the clinical
            characteristics (including some novel findings in four recently
            diagnosed patients), diagnosis, management, mutation spectrum and
            genetic counselling.
            Review article
